 es=[e for e in events if e['fingerprint']==row['fingerprint']];expected=['reserved','blocked','reserved',r['configs'][row['name']]['status']] if row['name'] in r['configs'] else ['reserved','rejected'];assert [e['status'] for e in es]==expected and es[-1]['result_available'] is True
 if len(es)==4:assert es[1]['result_available'] is False and es[2]['result_available'] is False
